  "commit_message": "fix(mcp): drop the backend after browser_close with a shared browser (#42365)\n\nFixes #42363\n\n### What happens\n\nWith the HTTP transport and `--shared-browser-context`, `browser_close` disposes the calling client's `BrowserBackend`: the `Context` is cleared and the dispose callback only decrements the client count, because another client keeps the shared browser alive. `server.ts` caches `backendPromise` per session and clears it only on the backend's `disconnected` event, which `BrowserBackend` e",
